{"seq":3,"slug":"guarantee-instrument-choice","title":"担保工具的选择与成本比较","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/customs-tax-guarantee-bond-insurance/tax-guarantee-instrument/guarantee-instrument-choice","wordCount":2536,"readingTime":11,"html":"<h1 id=\"担保工具的选择与成本比较\">担保工具的选择与成本比较</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>三种担保工具都能让海关放行，但企业付的代价完全不同：保证金付的是资金时间价值，银行保函付的是授信占用与手续费，关税保证保险付的是保费。选择问题因此不是&quot;哪个更快&quot;，而是一道在给定进口规模与缴税节奏下的成本最小化问题。本篇先建立可比较的成本口径，再讨论额度冗余与放行失败之间的权衡，最后给出在什么条件下应当切换工具。</p>\n<h2 id=\"全成本口径-把三种工具放到同一个尺度上\">全成本口径：把三种工具放到同一个尺度上</h2><p>比较的前提是把不同名目的支出折算成同一口径。可用的口径是<strong>年化资金成本率</strong>：把该工具在一年内导致的全部支出（含被占压资金的利息）除以它为企业提供的担保额度。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>成本项</th>\n<th>保证金</th>\n<th>银行保函</th>\n<th>关税保证保险</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>主要支出</td>\n<td>资金占压利息</td>\n<td>手续费（按保函金额年化）</td>\n<td>保费（按保额与期限）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>二次占用</td>\n<td>无</td>\n<td>占用银行授信额度</td>\n<td>通常不占用银行授信</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>押品要求</td>\n<td>全额现金</td>\n<td>常需反担保或质押</td>\n<td>一般无需押品</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>提前解除成本</td>\n<td>低（退款）</td>\n<td>中（保函注销）</td>\n<td>中（退保批改）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>额度弹性</td>\n<td>差（增额需再存钱）</td>\n<td>中（受授信约束）</td>\n<td>较好（可加保）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>对企业的隐性成本</td>\n<td>机会成本最高</td>\n<td>消耗与贷款共用的授信</td>\n<td>需通过承保审核</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[确定担保额度需求 Q] --&gt; B{企业授信是否紧张}&#10;  B --&gt;|是| C[优先不占授信的工具&lt;br/&gt;关税保证保险]&#10;  B --&gt;|否| D{资金成本是否很低}&#10;  D --&gt;|是| E[保证金可接受&lt;br/&gt;机会成本小]&#10;  D --&gt;|否| F[银行保函&lt;br/&gt;手续费 + 授信机会成本]&#10;  C --&gt; G[按峰值分位数加冗余]&#10;  E --&gt; G&#10;  F --&gt; G&#10;  G --&gt; H[年度复评: 信用等级/规模/费率]&#10;  H --&gt; A\">graph TD\n  A[确定担保额度需求 Q] --&gt; B{企业授信是否紧张}\n  B --&gt;|是| C[优先不占授信的工具&lt;br/&gt;关税保证保险]\n  B --&gt;|否| D{资金成本是否很低}\n  D --&gt;|是| E[保证金可接受&lt;br/&gt;机会成本小]\n  D --&gt;|否| F[银行保函&lt;br/&gt;手续费 + 授信机会成本]\n  C --&gt; G[按峰值分位数加冗余]\n  E --&gt; G\n  F --&gt; G\n  G --&gt; H[年度复评: 信用等级/规模/费率]\n  H --&gt; A</pre><h3 id=\"资金占压的量化\">资金占压的量化</h3><p>保证金的成本最容易算：被占压金额 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span> 乘以企业加权平均资金成本 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span>，即年成本 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">= C \\times r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.3669em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span>。若企业资金成本为 5%，一笔 1000 万的保证金每年实际支出 50 万——这笔钱不体现在任何账单上，但确实存在，也是保证金在实践中&quot;最贵&quot;的原因。</p>\n<p>银行保函的成本是名义手续费与授信机会成本之和。手续费率通常在千分之几的量级，但因为保函占用授信额度，若该授信本可用于流动资金贷款，则真实成本 = 手续费 + 授信额度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>×</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\times</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">×</span></span></span></span></span>（贷款利率 − 存款收益）。当企业授信紧张时，第二项往往远大于第一项。</p>\n<p>关税保证保险的成本是保费，结构上更接近风险定价：费率与企业信用等级、进口规模、历史缴税表现相关。它的优势是<strong>几乎不动用银行授信</strong>，因此对授信额度已经成为瓶颈的企业，&quot;多花保费、省下授信&quot;常常是正确的交换。</p>\n<h3 id=\"用一组参数做一次可复算的比较\">用一组参数做一次可复算的比较</h3><p>把上述口径落成可复算的算式，才能在同一张表上比较。设企业年进口税额为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span>、资金成本率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r=5\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5%</span></span></span></span></span>、银行保函手续费率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>f</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">f=0.3\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.3%</span></span></span></span></span>、保险费率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.6</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p=0.6\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.6%</span></span></span></span></span>、所需担保额度为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span></span></span></span></span>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>保证金</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>Q</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>r</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>保函</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>Q</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>f</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>Q</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mtext>loan</mtext></msub><mo>−</mo><msub><mi>r</mi><mtext>deposit</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><msub><mi>C</mi><mtext>保险</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>Q</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C_{\\text{保证金}} = Q \\cdot r,\\qquad C_{\\text{保函}} = Q \\cdot f + Q \\cdot (r_{\\text{loan}} - r_{\\text{deposit}}),\\qquad C_{\\text{保险}} = Q \\cdot p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">保证金</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">保函</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">loan</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">deposit</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0715em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">保险</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>以 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1000</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q = 1000</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1000</span></span></span></span></span> 万、贷款利率 4.5%、存款收益 1.5% 代入：保证金年成本 50 万；保函年成本 = 3 万手续费 + 30 万授信机会成本 = 33 万；保险年成本 = 6 万。三个数字的排序在典型参数下是<strong>保险 &lt; 保函 &lt; 保证金</strong>，而差额主要来自资金占压与授信机会成本这两项&quot;看不见的钱&quot;。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;instrument_cost_comparison&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;scenario&quot;: &quot;annual_import_tax_48m_peak_month_6.2m&quot;,&#10;    &quot;assumptions&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;wacc&quot;: 0.05,&#10;      &quot;loan_rate&quot;: 0.045,&#10;      &quot;deposit_rate&quot;: 0.015,&#10;      &quot;bank_guarantee_fee_rate&quot;: 0.003,&#10;      &quot;insurance_premium_rate&quot;: 0.006&#10;    },&#10;    &quot;quota_required&quot;: 9300000,&#10;    &quot;results&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;cash_deposit&quot;: { &quot;annual_cost&quot;: 465000, &quot;consumes_bank_credit&quot;: false },&#10;      &quot;bank_guarantee&quot;: { &quot;annual_cost&quot;: 306900, &quot;consumes_bank_credit&quot;: true, &quot;credit_consumed&quot;: 9300000 },&#10;      &quot;duty_insurance&quot;: { &quot;annual_cost&quot;: 55800, &quot;consumes_bank_credit&quot;: false }&#10;    },&#1